  "description": "IYAWAH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C8 H4 Cl14 O22 Pr4 Sb12 4-)n,4n(C6 H8 N1 1+). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr2_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.773-4.871 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 120.83-123.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (2-MepyH)4[Pr4Sb12O18Cl14(1,3-bdc)].",
